  "_comment": [
    "Figure slips: the per-match person's face and head-outline mistakes (POL#46 stage 2,",
    "docs/drawing-mistakes-research.md section 9, decision 8). Authored stand-ins for Study A's pool;",
    "the author picked these 11 of 35 by eye on 2026-11-02. Not yet built into the atlas.",
    "rows_5_10 replace idle's rows 5-10 (painter.json torso). Every locomotion frame shares them.",
    "An action frame listed under actions takes those rows; any other action frame takes idle's",
    "changed cells only where it still draws idle's original cell there.",
    "A match's person takes one or two slips; a pair listed in exclusive changes neighbouring cells",
    "(the same feature) and is never drawn together. Every slip and every other pair keeps the",
    "outline closed to a 4-connected fill, no pocket, a white row under the brim, and 2-cell pen runs."
